979
00:57:25.980 --> 00:57:28.481
Sam, come on.
Eyes on me, baby.

980
00:57:28.616 --> 00:57:30.151
Keep your eyes on me.

981
00:57:31.484 --> 00:57:32.720
Oh, shit.

982
00:57:33.654 --> 00:57:36.489
